WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.684
Hello, friend.

00:00:00.684 --> 00:00:04.445
Ever missed kick-off because you were still looking for the channel?

00:00:04.445 --> 00:00:05.813
That gets to me.

00:00:05.813 --> 00:00:07.864
You paid to see the match.

00:00:07.864 --> 00:00:11.284
Somebody else decided how many menus you'd have to cross.

00:00:11.284 --> 00:00:15.045
Let's put the guide you want on your own Fire TV.

00:00:15.045 --> 00:00:17.097
Keep the remote in your hand.

00:00:17.417 --> 00:00:19.487
Start at Fire TV Home.

00:00:19.487 --> 00:00:22.800
Open Settings, then My Fire TV, then About.

00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:25.284
Highlight the name of your device.

00:00:25.284 --> 00:00:28.182
Press the round centre button seven times.

00:00:28.182 --> 00:00:29.425
Press Back once.

00:00:29.425 --> 00:00:31.081
Look for Developer Options.

00:00:31.081 --> 00:00:32.323
Already see it?

00:00:32.323 --> 00:00:35.222
You're exactly where you need to be.

00:00:35.542 --> 00:00:36.387
Press Home.

00:00:36.387 --> 00:00:38.502
Go to Find, then Search.

00:00:38.502 --> 00:00:39.348
Type Downloader.

00:00:39.348 --> 00:00:43.999
Look for the orange icon from A F T V news.

00:00:43.999 --> 00:00:45.691
Choose Get or Download.

00:00:45.691 --> 00:00:47.805
Wait until you see Open.

00:00:48.125 --> 00:00:52.755
E Corp is the company that owns practically everything in Mr.

00:00:52.755 --> 00:00:53.176
Robot.

00:00:53.176 --> 00:00:55.281
Elliot and fsociety hack it.

00:00:55.281 --> 00:00:56.544
Our little rebellion?

00:00:56.544 --> 00:00:58.227
Picking our own guide.

00:00:58.227 --> 00:01:02.858
Open Settings, My Fire TV, Developer Options, then Install Unknown Apps.

00:01:02.858 --> 00:01:04.120
Switch Downloader on.

00:01:04.120 --> 00:01:07.488
Older sticks call it Apps from Unknown Sources.

00:01:07.488 --> 00:01:10.013
Leave A D B debugging off.

00:01:10.333 --> 00:01:11.192
Open Downloader.

00:01:11.192 --> 00:01:13.339
Select Home on the left.

00:01:13.339 --> 00:01:15.057
Click the address field.

00:01:15.057 --> 00:01:16.775
Enter six, nine, five.

00:01:16.775 --> 00:01:17.633
Two, seven.

00:01:17.633 --> 00:01:18.492
Three, five.

00:01:18.492 --> 00:01:20.210
Seven digits in all.

00:01:20.210 --> 00:01:23.216
Compare them with the number on screen.

00:01:23.216 --> 00:01:26.222
Choose Go, and wait for the installer.

00:01:26.542 --> 00:01:29.523
Look at the name on your television.

00:01:29.523 --> 00:01:31.653
It should say TT tv.

00:01:31.653 --> 00:01:32.504
Choose Install.

00:01:32.504 --> 00:01:35.486
Wait for the confirmation, then choose Open.

00:01:35.486 --> 00:01:40.597
Once you're finished installing apps, you can switch that Downloader permission off.

00:01:40.917 --> 00:01:42.768
Your provider supplies the channels.

00:01:42.768 --> 00:01:46.472
TT tv gives you a different way to find them.

00:01:46.472 --> 00:01:48.694
Speak to your provider about login.

00:01:48.694 --> 00:01:51.657
In TT tv, open Settings, then TV service.

00:01:51.657 --> 00:01:56.472
For movies and box sets, enter the Xtream details your provider gave you.

00:01:56.792 --> 00:01:58.254
Go back to Home.

00:01:58.254 --> 00:01:59.351
Open TV Guide.

00:01:59.351 --> 00:02:03.738
Move to a programme that's on now and press the centre button.

00:02:03.738 --> 00:02:04.835
There's your picture.

00:02:04.835 --> 00:02:06.663
That's all I wanted, friend.

00:02:06.663 --> 00:02:12.513
For the next ninety minutes, the biggest decision you make should be who to cheer for.

